  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening community capacity to demand access to and utilisation of land rights in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land is one the most fundamental resources to peoples&apos; living conditions, economic empowerment and, to some extent, their struggle for equity and equality.  Property rights over land are essential for a number of reasons, especially in rural areas where agriculture and other land dependent activities are the basis of the economy. This project aims to strengthen the community capacity to demand access to and utlization of land rights in Wakiso District, Uganda</narrative>
  </description>
